  "title": "LATAM Announces Pricing of Equity Offering",
  "summary": "Santiago (Chile), February 9, 2026 - LATAM Airlines Group S.A. (“LATAM” or the “Company”), the leading passenger and cargo airline group in South America, announced today the pricing of the previously announced public secondary offering by one of the Company’s shareholders to sell 12,000,000 American Depositary Shares (“ADSs”), each representing 2,000 common shares of LATAM. The selling shareholder has agreed with the underwriters that the ADSs will be sold to investors in the market at a price",
